{"sourceUrl":"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/info/1017/1903.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:41.493413+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/info/1017/1903.htm","html":"<div><div>\n\n<div>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、招收计划</span></span></strong></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>招生类型</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>专业</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>推免拟招收计划</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>专业型硕士</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>翻译</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>15</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span><span>  最终名额以招生简章为准。</span></span><strong><span><span>报名者须为能获得本科所在高校给予推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生，且所学专业为本专业或相近专业。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、报名条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>申请推荐免试硕士生</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.中华人民共和国公民。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.在正式推免前获得所在高校当年正式推免资格，并在教育部“推免服务系统”完成注册；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6.诚实守信，学风端正，无考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、报名流程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院翻译（专业型）</span></span><span><span>自本实施细则发布之时起即可开始预报名，预报名截止时间为</span></span><strong><span><span>9月15日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>12</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>:00</span></span></strong><span><span>，以我院邮箱（</span></span><span><span>20250086</span></span><span><span>@ucass.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>）收到邮件的时间为最终报名时间，提交申请材料者即表示进行预报名申请。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）提交申请材料</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人将电子版申请材料按顺序汇总为一个</span><span>pdf文档，以“</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>-姓名-</span></span><span><span>专硕</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>报考专业</span><span>”命名，于</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日（周</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>中午</span></span><span><span>12:00之前发送到邮箱</span></span><span><span>20250086</span></span><span><span>@ucass.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>如因特殊原因无法及时提交材料</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>应联系</span></span><span><span>我</span></span><span><span>院并说明情况。注意留存材料纸质原件或证书复印件，根据</span></span><span><span>我</span></span><span><span>院后续通知提交纸质版。</span></span><span><span>对不符合规定或弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消资格。材料清单如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>《中国社会科学院大学</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）学位研究生申请表》（须加盖推荐高校教务管理部门公章）（附件</span><span>1）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span>有效期内的身份证、每学期均注册的学生证复印件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span>本科阶段历年学习成绩单和排名证明（须加盖推荐高校教务</span></span><span><span>管理部门</span></span><span><span>公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4. </span></span><span><span>国家英语六级考试成绩单，或其他外语水平证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5. </span></span><span><span>公开发表的论文、著（译）作，如无公开发表的科研成果，可提供</span><span>2篇能够体现自身学术水平、科研能力的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等其它材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6. </span></span><span><span>获奖证书</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7. </span></span><span><span>个人简历等自我评价材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>8. </span></span><span><span>报考研究生人员思想政治素质和品德考核表（附件</span><span>2）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>9. </span></span><span><span>中国社会科学院大学</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年研究生招生考试复试考生诚信承诺书</span></span><span><span>（附件</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>10. </span></span><span><span>申请攻读研究生报告</span></span><span><span>（材料自拟）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）材料审核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院成立材料审核专家组，对推免生提交的申请材料进行审核并择优确定复试考生。复试名单将于</span><span>9月16日在中国社会科学院大学外国语学院网站公布。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（三）教育部推免服务系统</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span> </span><span><span>教育部</span><span>“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址:http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）为推免工作统一的信息备案公开平台和网上报考录取系统。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span> </span><span><span>申请人应</span></span><span><span>在规定时间内</span></span><span><span>，登录推免服务系统，在系统中注册和填写基本信息，完成网上报名、网上缴费、接受复试确认和待录取确认等环节。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、综合考核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院将成立综合考核小组，</span></span><span><span>采取网络远程复试方式进行，复试拟使用腾讯会议软件</span></span><span><span>（或相关软件）</span></span><span><span>，具体安排另行通知。请申请人及时</span></span><span><span>查看邮箱并</span></span><span><span>接听电话。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>翻译（专业型）</span></span></strong><span><span>复试时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>(星期</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>)，具体时间另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>外国语学院通讯地址（翻译硕士）：北京市房山区长于大街</span><span>11号中国社会科学院大学，联系人：</span></span><span><span>袁</span></span><span><span>老师，联系电话：</span><span>010-81360</span></span><span><span>466</span></span></p>\n<p><span>                           <span>中国社会科学院大学外国语学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>              </span><span>                       <span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1541925987&amp;wbfileid=16657852\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：中国社会科学院大学2027年接收推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）学位申请表.doc</a></span> <br/></p>\n<p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1541925987&amp;wbfileid=16657853\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：报考研究生人员思想政治素质和品德考核表.docx</a><br/></span></p>\n<p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1541925987&amp;wbfileid=16657854\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：研究生招生考试复试考生诚信承诺书.docx</a></span><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"02fd30dfb9649b98c074d496326fd55f249cdf4158314f427f6c01e6d57ea7b5","textLength":1462,"sourceSha256":"be673a406b7d8e23ed0509aaf52cef959217941fb5ec84b86c9fd63d2d1a6017","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-bd94d8c3f73e9c8e8713","title":"2026年中国社会科学院大学外国语学院2027年接收推荐免试攻读研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:41.493413+00:00"}
